#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/about/news/1671062400.md:0
msgid "Xfce 4.18 released"
msgstr "Sortie de Xfce 4.18"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1671062400.md:7
msgid ""
"After almost two years of work, we are happy to announce the release of Xfce "
"4.18 !"
msgstr ""
"Après presque deux ans de travail, nous sommes heureux de vous annoncer la "
"sortie de Xfce 4.18 !"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1671062400.md:11
msgid ""
"Since Xfce 4.16 a lot of major development happened. Our team added multiple "
"nice new features, did a gazillion of bug fixes and did various minor "
"improvements. Finally, all that is going to be released for your pleasure."
msgstr ""
"Depuis Xfce 4.16, de nombreux développements majeurs se sont produits. Notre "
"équipe a ajouté plusieurs nouvelles fonctionnalités intéressantes, effectué "
"un million de corrections de bogues et apporté diverses améliorations "
"mineures. Enfin, tout cela va être libéré pour votre plaisir."

#: content/about/news/1671062400.md:13
msgid ""
"<img src=\"//cdn.xfce.org/about/screenshots/4.18-1.png\" border=\"0\" "
"alt=\"Xfce 4.18 screenshot\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1671062400.md:15
msgid ""
"This development cycle was influenced a lot by [GSoC 2021](https://"
"summerofcode.withgoogle.com/archive/2021/organizations/5706869816950784) and "
"[GSoC 2022](https://summerofcode.withgoogle.com/programs/2022/organizations/"
"xfce), which led to various new features, most of them for Thunar, the Xfce "
"File Manager. Though as well multiple other Xfce components got a lot of "
"love and many improvements were done under the hood."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1671062400.md:17
msgid ""
"Assuming you have installed Xfce 4.16, here is an overview on the major "
"changes you will see on an upgrade to Xfce 4.18:"
msgstr ""
"En supposant que vous avez installé Xfce 4.16, voici un aperçu des "
"principaux changements que vous verrez lors d’une mise à niveau vers Xfce "
"4.18 :"

#: content/about/news/1671062400.md:19
msgid "<https://www.xfce.org/about/tour418>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1671062400.md:21
msgid ""
"A detailed overview of the changes between Xfce 4.16 and Xfce 4.18 releases "
"can be found on the following page:"
msgstr ""
"Un aperçu détaillé des changements entre les versions Xfce 4.16 et Xfce 4.18 "
"est disponible sur la page suivante :"

#: content/about/news/1671062400.md:23
msgid "<https://www.xfce.org/download/changelogs/4.18>"
msgstr ""

#: content/about/news/1671062400.md:27
#, fuzzy
msgid "<https://archive.xfce.org/xfce/4.18>"
msgstr "[Télécharger](http://archive.xfce.org/xfce/4.6.1/)"

